    "## 2. Preprocessing (CPU, ANTs) - brain extraction, N4, affine to MNI, crop to 160×192×160\n",
    "\n",
    "Matches the SFCN pretraining geometry (1 mm MNI). **Checkpoint 1 / stop rule:** if more than 25% of scans fail, stop and report (plan §4.0). QC mid-slices are saved for eyeballing.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
