    "## 3. Model - the original SFCN, frozen (Peng et al., 2021)\n",
    "\n",
    "We download the released brain-age checkpoint and keep **only the six convolutional blocks** as a frozen feature extractor - exactly what Das et al. did. The classifier is discarded. The head we train is separate (§5).\n"
